  "body": "In the spec([HTML Standard (whatwg.org)](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#dndevents)), the dropEffect column in the [table](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#dndevents) seems to describe the default value of DataTransfer object’s attribute. But that’s not clearly conveyed. Should it be updated to explicitly convey it represents default value?",
